    "general_python": "${GENERAL_PYTHON}"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Whole-wing unconstrained trailing-edge morphing sanity check requested by Marco.",
    "The purpose is workflow verification: with only CDi in the objective and no engineering constraints, the lift distribution should move toward an elliptical reference.",
    "This run is not intended as an actuator-feasible engineering candidate."
